{"resourceIdentifier":"2921","resourceName":"Jilin Baishishan Afforestation Project","description":"Jilin Baishishan Afforestation Project  is located in Jiaohe City , Dunhua City , Jilin Province, China.  The project’s aim is to increase carbon sequestration and contribute to local sustainable development by planting trees on suitable lands for forest. The project proponent is Jilin Forest Industry Environmental Technology Co., Ltd.\r\nAn area of 18,409.03 ha, which belongs to Baishishan Forestry Co.,Ltd, have been planted, on 1,579 parcels of lands. All the trees are native species, including Pinus koraiensis, Fraxinus mandshurica, Spruce and Juglans mandshurica. No invasive alien species or genetically modified organisms are involved.","location":{"latitude":43.283332,"longitude":127.366664},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-06-15","endExclusive":"2022-07-16","endInclusive":"2022-07-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2921"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jilin"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jilin Forest Industry Environmental Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jilin Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Rejected by Administrator"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"388261"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18409 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Quality Certification Center (CQC)"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO"